  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is very nice. My mom and I went to the mall to buy some things. There were lots of people in the mall, and everyone looked happy. I saw a red dress. It was long and very pretty. Mom said, \"This dress costs more than two thousand yuan. It's too expensive.\" I said, \"Then let's go and look over there.\" Over there was a small shop with lots of school bags. I bought a small white school bag for a little over a hundred yuan. Mom bought a new piece of clothing too, and she looked lovely in it. We also saw a big TV that cost more than ten thousand yuan! Mom laughed and said, \"We're not buying that.\""
  ],
